## Acceptance checks

- The scope and result count are visible.
- A person can remove a filter without retyping the query.
- Empty and unavailable states read differently.
- The examples work at narrow widths, with a keyboard and without JavaScript.

Test a production implementation against its real data and permissions before calling it supported.

